<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Sept 23.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Sept 23.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kavo Mangalia 20,000 long tons heavy grains 27/9-5/10 Paranagua/ARA $13.00 fio five days Dreyfus.</p>
<p>Marie Flood 23,250 long tons wheat 10-20/10 California/Arica or Antofagasta $39.50 Bolivia.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
